time complexity or Big(O)notation
   ex : arr = {3,5,6,7}

   print(arr[3]);

constant time complexity----------> O(1)
    : explaination:
    it directly prints arr[3] without knowing others 
    have constant time or less
    one iteration
linear time complexity 
    : explaination
    time is dependent on no of iterations of single row and multuple colums
    ----> time complexity is n 
    ----->for one loop 
    O(n)
quadratic time complexity 
    : explaination
    time is depentant on no of iterations of multiple row and colums
    ----> time complexity is square of n
    ----->for two loops
    O(n(square))
factorial time complexity 
    : explaination
    time is depentant on n!
    O(n!)
exponential time complexity 
    :explaination
    n raise to n 
    O(2 raise to n)

logarithimic time complexity 
    :explaination
    O(log n)  
example: binary search 